.TH ZEUS 1 "July 2026" "Zeus Engineering Platform"
.SH NAME
zeus \- supervised Zeus engineering operator interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zeus
[\-\-help] [command] [options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Provides repository-independent access to Zeus engineering lifecycle state.
.SH MISSION MODEL
Missions remain supervised and authority-bound.
.SH ENGINEERING LIFECYCLE
Publication, PMCT, independent verification, acceptance, and execution are distinct.
.SH WORK ORDERS
Engineering Work Orders remain controlled records and are not implied by CLI use.
.SH OA GATES
Use verify and approve as separate governed boundaries.
.SH AUTHORITY PUBLICATION
Signed baselines are managed by authority-publishctl.
.SH DISPATCH
Dispatch remains disabled until independently commissioned.
.SH RESUME
Resume observes recorded state and never manufactures approval.
.SH COMMANDS
status, next-action, verify, accept, approve, dispatcher, resume, and additional commands shown by help.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B zeus next-action
.br
.B zeus help verify
.br
.B zeus accept OA-01 --reject --rationale "qualification incomplete"
.br
.B zeus verify OA-02
.SH FILES
.I .zeus/runtime
and repository-controlled engineering records.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 2 invalid invocation; 78 failed prerequisite or governed-state error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pmct (1)
